+|----------------|---------|---------------------|
+| `.../agnosticd.git` | v1 | parse from `git_url` (commonly `redhat-cop/agnosticd`) |
+| `.../agnosticd-v2.git` | v2 | parse from `git_url` (the owner VARIES — read it) |
